WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Watch Noura.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Narrator: She steps back, never touches anyone, and reports.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.200
Narrator: She moves families away - the same calm words to both teams' fans.

4
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:34.100
Noura: I saw one man in a white shirt push another, then walk towards Block C. I haven't seen anyone hurt so far.

5
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:39.800
Narrator: When the police arrive, she says what she saw, and what she hasn't seen.

6
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.700
Officer: Got it - we'll take it from here.

7
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.600
Narrator: The officer confirms he has it; Noura confirms what she'll keep doing.

8
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:52.900
Noura: I'll keep the families back from this area.

9
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.800
Noura: Sierra 2 - police have the incident; I'm keeping the area clear.

10
00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.900
Narrator: Then she tells her supervisor.

11
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Narrator: Five steps, no drama.

